<description>&lt;p&gt;Egypt reopened its embassy in Tripoli, restoring diplomatic ties after twelve years. Libyan authorities detained a translator and arrested a man in Tripoli for throwing grenades at the army. A fire triggered an explosion at the Marsa Brega gas complex, killing one worker and injuring four. ISIS militants killed a young Christian man after he refused to deny Jesus. Combat intensity remains low, with 2 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMioAFBVV95cUxOUmxJSTBtNC0zNWtPUkRhQ1JxS2dCRndtN3o1cURid3ZkdTRjTmthSmRubHJONFNBYlFLT1MwVGVyUENyNnYyYTU3Rnp5YjRSa3Z0NWprOWl6ckx4T3hXS3dGeThhZjlzWHFZSDNrX2VabUlaZWhKQUJORlJBYlFqNTJNYWRCaWcxLWhDTkxIRVl2Q2JvYlFVajdlN050dlI0?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxNU0Y3N3dwVkdGV1BpRmwxQ0FIYmYxVlRabkE2VU96bEVLMVhGVG01VTd6VDdpWFM0bktUSTZJczFsX2pHWWZ6SjN3RUVBbGRwaGJJUWtOUUFWcW1CUVV6bzItdjNHVm0zUmJ5VEI4RVhDLUV2RFV4Z3d5NGphSER3cXFBTHg3RDV3Smg4c0tUTVFTUHg0X2paSmRORWk?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivwFBVV95cUxNWEFrbS1jXzhrcGhDYkc5T0M5ODBOeFpBd25KdDZaUFB6MDFBUFlLWElsdk94c2ktOVZ3bjc0RTlsaVBXTGlMb3lPdGhYSlZkTHZtaFdEektzdjdlNWVQRmZZWE0zU2NEdGljcmZjUFJTQ2pIYU9ubThNUURmd1hjWkdKQndOMk84MmlXTXVLcFE0Mi1wek1WbnRwSmRHQnkwaU4wejNiaVJXN2NPbU5sSWxPZVlBV0tfLVhvZzJkdw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikgFBVV95cUxQQ0VYbGxXb2dZeDljOGZSU01tWmNpcktQbW1tWnVRZGdoTEZ6Y3BVOWRQQXNYSDhnVWVQdUoyR05HQVJnV29sZV96UTA4dGZUdlRJM3E0ZUZVZVF5QzJ4V1JWNTI2WnpadWdTVUdrZFQxOEw4OHU2elVwQU9FaXdjUmZrY2dqSFhzQWZxdnl3M2Rkdw?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Libya Observer&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijAFBVV95cUxNamxSb2ZyNXhNSUNSaGJ0VXFKLWtUVDB1b1VPS205MnEzZk0